  The stream's own locale holds the facet, so the warning is likely
  a false positive; to be read before anything is changed.
- =-Wunused-local-typedefs=: =21.string.append= 579 (=StringIter=).
- =-Wunused-but-set-variable=: =tests/src/char.cpp= 1140 and 1142
